WEBVTT

02:31.180 --> 02:33.650
<b>Damn it! Why aren't they dying?!</b>

02:36.630 --> 02:39.680
<b>The front gate is about to 
fall! Go there now!</b>

02:40.000 --> 02:40.680
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

02:57.720 --> 02:59.630
<b>Where have you been?!</b>

02:59.630 --> 03:02.180
<b>Unrelated personnel,
please leave right now.</b>

03:02.180 --> 03:03.840
<b>They're all mages.</b>

03:03.840 --> 03:05.930
<b>They're here to help me finish my shift.</b>

03:06.540 --> 03:08.610
<b>Then put on your mage emblems.</b>

03:08.610 --> 03:10.520
<b>Otherwise, you'll be scolded 
by the councilors.</b>

03:16.720 --> 03:18.950
<b>Our team is heading outside the wall.</b>

03:18.950 --> 03:21.060
<b>We're looking for Intermediate mages.</b>

03:23.060 --> 03:25.710
<b>You two should help out 
around the wall tower.</b>

03:25.710 --> 03:27.040
<b>Don't go deeper in.</b>

03:28.410 --> 03:29.610
<b>What about yours?</b>

03:29.610 --> 03:31.850
<b>Did you not hear me, or are 
you even lower than them?</b>

03:32.380 --> 03:35.180
<b>He's the new student rep 
from Pearl Institute...</b>

03:35.770 --> 03:38.980
<b>Huh? Uh... Whatever.</b>

03:40.430 --> 03:44.010
<b>A new student rep from Pearl and 
he's just Intermediate Level 2?</b>

03:44.010 --> 03:46.270
<b>Turns out these prestigious 
schools aren't all that, huh?</b>

03:47.580 --> 03:49.580
<b>That's an emblem for your 
secondary element, isn't it?</b>

03:50.700 --> 03:52.270
<b>I just grabbed a random one.</b>

03:53.980 --> 03:55.790
<b>That guy sucks.</b>

03:55.790 --> 03:58.010
<b>You should show off a little 
and scare him in a bit.</b>

04:00.630 --> 04:03.670
<b><i>Attention! General-rank undead 
appearing in the northeast!</i></b>

04:03.670 --> 04:05.330
<b><i>Destroy it immediately!</i></b>

04:09.400 --> 04:10.590
<b>Prepare for departure!</b>

04:10.590 --> 04:12.260
<b>Fights against 
general-rank undead are fierce!</b>

04:12.260 --> 04:13.600
<b>Be careful, everyone!</b>

04:28.000 --> 04:29.010
<b>Annihilate it.</b>

04:29.010 --> 04:30.930
<b>We must not let it get 
close to the city walls.</b>

04:30.930 --> 04:33.430
<b>Don't worry. We have 
seven Intermediate mages.</b>

04:33.430 --> 04:35.730
<b>It won't be a problem against 
one general-rank undead.</b>

04:37.040 --> 04:40.140
<b>All right. I'll get mages at the 
wall towers to open a path for you.</b>

04:47.560 --> 04:50.040
<b>The rest will be up to you guys.</b>

04:51.390 --> 04:53.930
<b>Straight ahead! Clear it out!</b>

05:04.480 --> 05:05.430
<b>Keep going!</b>

05:12.040 --> 05:13.220
<b>Strike!</b>

05:48.100 --> 05:50.770
<b>Stay alert! Something isn't right...</b>

06:07.710 --> 06:08.470
<b>Guys, look!</b>

06:10.020 --> 06:12.270
<b>Damn it! It's a Fierce Bone General!</b>

06:12.270 --> 06:13.640
<b>Rock Wall!</b>

06:21.710 --> 06:22.810
<b>Spread out!</b>

07:00.430 --> 07:01.600
<b>Are you all right?</b>

07:01.990 --> 07:03.180
<b>I can still hang in there.</b>

07:08.560 --> 07:09.590
<b>Stand farther back!</b>

07:27.850 --> 07:29.010
<b>Back off!</b>

07:29.010 --> 07:30.720
<b>Let it have a taste of my Wind Coil!</b>

07:58.720 --> 08:00.300
<b>What kind of witchcraft is that?!</b>

08:02.700 --> 08:05.430
<b>The body of the Fierce Bone General 
is frozen and strong as steel.</b>

08:05.430 --> 08:07.450
<b>It has unparalleled strength.</b>

08:07.450 --> 08:10.220
<b>It's far more difficult to deal with 
than other undead of the same rank.</b>

08:11.600 --> 08:13.340
<b>This just isn't our day.</b>

08:13.340 --> 08:14.240
<b>Let's retreat for now!</b>

08:14.240 --> 08:15.450
<b>We'll think of something!</b>

08:15.980 --> 08:18.360
<b>No! If we let it near the wall,</b>

08:18.360 --> 08:19.930
<b>it'll wreak havoc!</b>

08:21.290 --> 08:22.190
<b>Watch out!</b>

08:27.880 --> 08:28.990
<b>Nether Shield!</b>

08:37.170 --> 08:38.570
<b>You're not the only one who can pierce!</b>

08:47.250 --> 08:48.270
<b>His armor is so thick!</b>

08:48.590 --> 08:49.470
<b>Let's book it!</b>

08:49.970 --> 08:52.400
<b><i>No. Zhou Min won't be able 
to use Shield Shadow.</i></b>

08:52.400 --> 08:54.180
<b><i>Our only choice is to fight it head-on.</i></b>

08:55.120 --> 08:56.530
<b><i>Mystical Snake Armor!</i></b>

09:30.930 --> 09:33.470
<b>That was close. I almost broke something.</b>

09:33.470 --> 09:35.750
<b>Wh-What kind of defense is that?</b>

09:35.750 --> 09:37.430
<b>What amazing magical armor!</b>

09:38.400 --> 09:40.140
<b>Armored Saint Knight...</b>

09:41.430 --> 09:42.580
<b>What are you waiting for?!</b>

09:42.580 --> 09:45.270
<b>Mu Bai, quickly use your 
ice magic to freeze its legs</b>

09:45.270 --> 09:46.280
<b>until they're brittle!</b>

09:46.280 --> 09:48.390
<b>And then we'll attack its legs together!</b>

09:53.070 --> 09:54.100
<b>Got it!</b>

10:00.770 --> 10:01.760
<b>I'll join in, too!</b>

10:10.560 --> 10:11.890
<b>Let's add some fuel!</b>

10:16.970 --> 10:18.590
<b>Yes! Now!</b>

10:19.010 --> 10:19.960
<b>Thunderbolt!</b>

10:29.830 --> 10:31.180
<b>How'd you miss?!</b>

10:32.290 --> 10:34.310
<b>What's with your terrible Mind's Eye?!</b>

10:34.310 --> 10:35.890
<b>Shut up, moron!</b>

10:46.580 --> 10:51.270
<b>So your spiritual thunder can vibrate the 
air to shatter its frozen bones!</b>

10:58.840 --> 11:00.780
<b>You're so amazing, Mo Fan!</b>

11:09.220 --> 11:10.500
<b>Impressive!</b>

11:10.500 --> 11:13.130
<b>Fierce Bone Generals are almost 
as strong as Great Bone Generals.</b>

11:13.130 --> 11:15.270
<b>You guys actually killed it in one go!</b>

11:16.160 --> 11:18.140
<b>It's all thanks to this student.</b>

11:18.880 --> 11:21.210
<b>Some people don't really have hobbies</b>

11:21.210 --> 11:23.200
<b>and just like to talk out of their ass...</b>

11:23.200 --> 11:26.370
<b>In the end, they just end 
up as a side character.</b>

11:26.370 --> 11:29.770
<b>And they get to brag about it 
afterwards for extra school credits.</b>

11:30.470 --> 11:31.340
<b>I—</b>

11:46.170 --> 11:47.350
<b>What's going on?</b>

11:47.350 --> 11:48.530
<b>That's the alarm!</b>

11:48.530 --> 11:50.020
<b>There's another big one coming!</b>

11:50.350 --> 11:51.720
<b>What is it this time?</b>

11:51.720 --> 11:55.580
<b>I don't know, but it's going to be way 
bigger than the Fierce Bone General!</b>

11:57.750 --> 11:58.600
<b>No...</b>

12:00.930 --> 12:02.980
<b>Four...?!</b>

12:02.980 --> 12:06.350
<b>Everyone without a mission, 
go to the northern tower! Now! Go!</b>

12:07.500 --> 12:09.970
<b>Looks like something big 
is happening. Do we go?</b>

12:09.970 --> 12:12.960
<b>Gather signals are usually voluntary 
for mages to go and help,</b>

12:12.960 --> 12:15.040
<b>but sending four simultaneously
changes that entirely.</b>

12:15.040 --> 12:16.520
<b>It becomes obligatory.</b>

12:16.520 --> 12:18.320
<b>Those who intentionally ignore the call</b>

12:18.320 --> 12:20.390
<b>will be expelled from
 their organizations.</b>

12:20.870 --> 12:22.100
<b>Then let's go.</b>

12:22.100 --> 12:22.990
<b>Mo Fan!</b>

12:34.700 --> 12:37.810
<b>I wonder how Liu Ru and Xiaohou 
are doing right now...</b>

12:54.810 --> 12:57.620
<b>Damn this place! How can people 
live here where it's so crowded!</b>

13:01.340 --> 13:03.870
<b>It's not like you guys will be living 
here for much longer anyway.</b>

13:20.100 --> 13:21.610
<b>It's really strange...</b>

13:21.610 --> 13:24.000
<b>The Kun well water at Yangyang 
Village suddenly disappeared,</b>

13:24.000 --> 13:26.490
<b>then the Kun well water at
our village disappeared too.</b>

13:26.490 --> 13:28.080
<b>I suspect there's a traitor...</b>

13:30.000 --> 13:30.890
<b>Follow.</b>

13:43.920 --> 13:45.820
<b>It's me, Cleric Xie Jun.</b>

13:57.460 --> 14:00.640
<b>Steward, I've brought the people 
to the designated courtyard.</b>

14:01.280 --> 14:04.240
<b>Didn't you say you had another 
portion of the Kun well water?</b>

14:04.240 --> 14:05.750
<b>Why have you not presented it?</b>

14:06.790 --> 14:10.180
<b>That portion of water is in the 
hands of a girl named Su Xiaoluo.</b>

14:10.500 --> 14:13.740
<b>I see. We have to get rid 
of them anyway.</b>

14:13.740 --> 14:15.490
<b>Let's kill two birds with one stone.</b>

14:15.490 --> 14:18.200
<b>Neither the Great Steward nor myself
like to leave threats unaddressed.</b>

14:18.200 --> 14:19.020
<b>Understood!</b>

14:40.870 --> 14:42.860
<b>It was Xie Jun who stole
 the Kun well water!</b>

14:42.860 --> 14:44.740
<b>And he's offering it to 
some shady organization!</b>

14:46.830 --> 14:47.820
<b>Black...</b>

14:49.220 --> 14:50.140
<b>Black...</b>

14:51.120 --> 14:53.310
<b>Va... Vatican!</b>

14:55.190 --> 14:57.020
<b>We need to tell everyone to run!</b>

15:06.310 --> 15:08.350
<b>There are only Intermediate mages here...</b>

15:10.460 --> 15:11.680
<b>Mr. Councilor.</b>

15:11.680 --> 15:12.670
<b>Mr. Zhu Meng, sir.</b>

15:14.150 --> 15:15.740
<b>Is this everyone?</b>

15:19.640 --> 15:21.020
<b>Why are you here, brat?</b>

15:21.020 --> 15:23.610
<b>I was just thinking what 
a pain it is to see you...</b>

15:24.850 --> 15:27.430
<b>Running into you means 
something bad's gonna happen.</b>

15:27.430 --> 15:28.340
<b>How dare you!</b>

15:28.340 --> 15:29.340
<b>No matter.</b>

15:29.990 --> 15:32.570
<b>I see you've still got
 a sharp tongue, brat.</b>

15:32.570 --> 15:33.820
<b>You're already here.</b>

15:33.820 --> 15:35.740
<b>Help me devise a plan.</b>

15:41.200 --> 15:44.000
<b>I'm glad you were all 
able to make it today.</b>

15:44.000 --> 15:47.120
<b>But I must give you all 
some unfortunate news.</b>

15:49.550 --> 15:54.930
<b>An Evil Spirit Abyss has appeared 
thirty kilometers to the north.</b>

15:57.260 --> 16:00.150
<b>An Evil Spirit Abyss? 
<i>That</i> Evil Spirit Abyss?</b>

16:00.150 --> 16:02.750
<b>How can something like that 
appear near the city?!</b>

16:02.750 --> 16:03.860
<b>Is there some kind of mistake?</b>

16:03.860 --> 16:05.980
<b>My goodness! Only thirty kilometers away!</b>

16:05.980 --> 16:08.220
<b>Are we really going to get thrown 
into that kind of chaos?!</b>

16:09.750 --> 16:11.620
<b>What's an Evil Spirit Abyss?</b>

16:11.620 --> 16:13.720
<b>Why's everyone freaking 
out about it?</b>

16:14.020 --> 16:16.890
<b>I once watched a ruler-rank undead</b>

16:16.890 --> 16:19.560
<b>swallow an entire team of hunters whole,</b>

16:20.100 --> 16:23.460
<b>and I thought that was the 
scariest thing in the world...</b>

16:24.140 --> 16:27.260
<b>That is, until I saw 
an Evil Spirit Abyss...</b>

16:27.940 --> 16:30.180
<b>It's like standing at the gates of hell.</b>

16:30.180 --> 16:34.820
<b>You can see into the depths of hell 
standing atop an Evil Spirit Abyss...</b>

16:36.820 --> 16:41.540
<b>Everyone says that hell is 
the worst fate for the dead,</b>

16:41.540 --> 16:46.350
<b>but those people have
never seen an Evil Spirit Abyss!</b>

16:47.450 --> 16:48.390
<b>For real?</b>

16:48.800 --> 16:50.990
<b>I've heard they're not just an 
opening into hell.</b>

16:51.690 --> 16:54.100
<b>They've also got a terrifying trait...</b>

16:54.100 --> 16:55.560
<b>Which is...?</b>

16:55.560 --> 16:57.560
<b>Dimensional uncertainty!</b>

16:57.560 --> 16:58.890
<b>Huh?</b>

16:59.600 --> 17:03.050
<b>It's that you don't know where 
they're going to appear,</b>

17:03.050 --> 17:05.310
<b>nor where they'll appear next.</b>

17:07.120 --> 17:08.600
<b>So like dimensional travel?</b>

17:09.120 --> 17:11.850
<b>Once resentment builds to a certain level,</b>

17:11.850 --> 17:14.810
<b>the dimensional burden becomes too 
heavy and will twist and shatter.</b>

17:15.440 --> 17:19.770
<b>This is where an Evil
Spirit Abyss time travels...</b>

17:20.180 --> 17:23.490
<b>As for how it achieves this, 
we have no way of knowing.</b>

17:23.490 --> 17:27.610
<b>Even a Forbidden Curse Mage would 
fall into this furnace of hell.</b>

17:27.610 --> 17:31.610
<b>And now... it looms closer and closer.</b>

17:33.140 --> 17:35.820
<b>The next location the Evil 
Spirit Abyss will appear...</b>

17:35.820 --> 17:37.470
<b>is Tin City!</b>

17:41.730 --> 17:44.730
<b>Translator: Bridget Kan</b>

17:44.730 --> 17:47.730
<b>Editor: Salem Alabanza</b>

17:47.730 --> 17:50.730
<b>Quality Control: Gabriella Alabanza</b>

17:50.730 --> 17:53.730
<b>Timer and Final Quality Control:
Henry Lin</b>

19:08.720 --> 19:11.570
<b><i>The Dark Specter Tyrant 
is using the undead aura</i></b>

19:11.570 --> 19:14.920
<b><i>brought upon by the Evil Spirit 
Abyss to gather his undead army.</i></b>

19:14.920 --> 19:17.430
<b><i>They're getting closer and closer 
to this city of a million people!</i></b>

19:17.430 --> 19:19.240
<b><i>If we don't endure past tonight,</i></b>

19:19.240 --> 19:21.780
<b><i>the northern wall will fall entirely.</i></b>

19:21.780 --> 19:24.970
<b><i>I'll leave it to you to be 
the captain and gather mages.</i></b>

19:24.970 --> 19:26.280
<b><i>It's in your hands.</i></b>

19:26.280 --> 19:28.520
<b><i>Make that brat Mo Fan my vice captain</i></b>

19:28.520 --> 19:30.110
<b><i>and have him support me the entire way.</i></b>

19:30.110 --> 19:32.430
<b><i>Careful! Our target might be nearby!</i></b>

19:32.430 --> 19:35.010
<b><i>Remember, our mission is to protect 
the light element magic circle.</i></b>

19:35.010 --> 19:36.830
<b><i>We're not going to waste time on them.</i></b>

19:36.830 --> 19:37.660
<b><i>Defense!</i></b>
